  <colors>
    <!--
      The parent is Darcula because a bundledColorScheme may only inherit from a scheme the
      platform is certain to have registered, and Darcula is one of the two in
      DefaultColorSchemesManager. Islands Dark, the previous parent, is contributed by a plugin
      and is absent unless the Islands UI is active, which made the IDE drop this scheme with
      "InvalidDataException: Islands Dark". Islands Dark is Darcula plus overrides, so every
      override it used to supply is written out below and in the attributes section.
    -->
